Dear Students,

I apologise for having overlooked that the higher number of attendees, 
compared to previous editions, has made the time allotted for prof. 
Losio's exam very tight.

Considering that prof. Amoroso's program is even wider, please be 
advised that we will use most of the time available on Friday 26th 
(14-18) for the exam. I leave him and the tutors in charge of finding 
the most suitable organization, most likely entirely online, and 
possibly with a set order of appearance if deemed appropriate by prof. 
Amoroso.

I would like to take the stage to send a (not so) final greeting to all 
of you, if you can connect for just a few minutes at the end, let's say 
17:30 all together. Unfortunately I cannot propose to do it at the 
opening, because even if my flight from Brussels is on time, I will be 
disembarking right then.

Best regards

  Marco Prandini

